abstract: >-
  PySegment is an open-source, offline desktop workstation for quantitative PET/CT and SPECT/CT. It combines
  manual and semi-automatic segmentation, multi-reader studies, ROI measurements, IBSI-compliant radiomics,
  rigid, affine and deformable registration and radionuclide dosimetry in one program. Every module that
  produces a number is validated against public reference data (IBSI, QIBA, POPI, ICRP 107).
